    "english":  "The wild jasmine grows luxuriantly amidst the clefts of the crags,\nscenting the nocturnal air where the leopard stalks its prey.\nIn the dead of midnight, when even the guardian dogs sleep,\nyou brave the slippery footpaths of the dense bamboo slopes.\nIf the fierce sentinels of our hamlet should hear your stealthy step,\nor if a rock should give way beneath your foot on the dark slope,\nwhat would become of this life of mine that hangs solely upon yours?\nRefrain, my lord, from these dangerous secret meetings,\nand seek me lawfully through the counsel of our clan elders!",
